  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 300px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">List I</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">(molecules/ions)</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">List II</p>\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\">(No. of lone pairs of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math><br />\t\t\ton central atom)</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(A)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>IF</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td>Three</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(B)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>ICl</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td>One</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(C)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td>Two</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(D)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV.</td>\t\t\t<td>Zero</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the <strong>correct</strong> answer from the options given below:</p>"
  },
