  "solution": {
    "text": "From the following lewis structures of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>IF</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>ICl</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0094_ffd8ce1ab013.png\" style=\"width: 134px; height: 150px;\" />,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0094_1e4bf4bb874c.png\" style=\"width: 173px; height: 150px;\" />,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0094_92130f39ff28.png\" style=\"width: 124px; height: 150px;\" />&nbsp;and&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0094_7e35d6e38d61.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 64px;\" /><br />we can deduce the number of lone pairs as well as the hybridisation of the central atom:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>IF</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>zero</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msubsup><mi>ICl</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>two</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>one</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>three</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>"
